---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy - Villa Paris" description="Cookie policy of Villa Paris, wedding and event venue in Roseto degli Abruzzi." locale="en">
  <section class="section-padding bg-dotted pt-40">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
      <div class="line-accent mb-6"></div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light tracking-wide mb-8">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none text-muted-foreground font-body leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p><strong>What are cookies</strong><br/>Cookies are small text files that visited websites send to your browser and are stored to enable the site to function properly.</p>
        <p><strong>Cookies used</strong><br/>This site uses essential technical cookies necessary for the proper functioning of the pages. The contacts page embeds a Google Maps map: interacting with the map may load third-party cookies and resources managed by Google.</p>
        <p><strong>Managing cookies</strong><br/>You can manage cookie preferences directly from your browser settings. Disabling technical cookies may affect some site functionality.</p>
        <p><strong>More information</strong><br/>For more information contact us at info@villaparis.it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
